(7668829, 1251679, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is pigeonish!  Even the clever title!</td>', 'This is pigeonish!  Even the clever title!', '2020-07-06 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668832, 1251503, 50695, '<td valign="top">"a bell that now and then rings" bells are all over song lyrics, as their function is primarily sonic, like a song, and they often have powerful symbolism, as they ring for very specific reasons, like a wedding or a funeral or to mark an historic occasion. this bell looks rather personal but the angle and the framing make it seem larger than it is.... the personal made epic. Perhaps this bell marks the dramas, successes, and traumas of a single family. Only the owl knows at this point.</td>', '"a bell that now and then rings" bells are all over song lyrics, as their function is primarily sonic, like a song, and they often have powerful symbolism, as they ring for very specific reasons, like a wedding or a funeral or to mark an historic occasion. this bell looks rather personal but the angle and the framing make it seem larger than it is.... the personal made epic. Perhaps this bell marks the dramas, successes, and traumas of a single family. Only the owl knows at this point.', '2020-07-06 12:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668834, 1251650, 50695, '<td valign="top">not a fan of car close-ups in general but of course this is about the reflection, which is very interesting because it suggests many things: a face in profile, a zebra walking by (or perhaps just a zebra rug). you even caught the furry texture of the zebra somehow. maybe this is a new superhero who bends reality, or a supervillain who refuses to choose between light and darkness.</td>', 'not a fan of car close-ups in general but of course this is about the reflection, which is very interesting because it suggests many things: a face in profile, a zebra walking by (or perhaps just a zebra rug). you even caught the furry texture of the zebra somehow. maybe this is a new superhero who bends reality, or a supervillain who refuses to choose between light and darkness.', '2020-07-06 12:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668835, 1251560, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a simple enough photo but I do like the composition. good negative space and the ears going out of frame make for a more dynamic composition. the dog is certainly helping out with its soulful look and coy paws.</td>', 'this is a simple enough photo but I do like the composition. good negative space and the ears going out of frame make for a more dynamic composition. the dog is certainly helping out with its soulful look and coy paws.', '2020-07-06 12:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668836, 1251708, 50695, '<td valign="top">it''s hard to tell whether they''re coming or going, but I think they''re coming, which means the day is already behind them, shining so brilliantly in their strong, fresh memory that it is almost blasted out of existence with its own beauty. The tunnel represents getting older. It has a lovely sheen that is reflected youth. While much less resplendent, it is easier to appreciate because it is soft and subtle. Youth is blinded by the light.</td>', 'it''s hard to tell whether they''re coming or going, but I think they''re coming, which means the day is already behind them, shining so brilliantly in their strong, fresh memory that it is almost blasted out of existence with its own beauty. The tunnel represents getting older. It has a lovely sheen that is reflected youth. While much less resplendent, it is easier to appreciate because it is soft and subtle. Youth is blinded by the light.', '2020-07-06 12:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668843, 1251254, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love this!  What a happy photo! The colors and space are just perfect.  I think this is my favorite of the challenge as the title is also so well thought out. Very nice.</td>', 'Love this!  What a happy photo! The colors and space are just perfect.  I think this is my favorite of the challenge as the title is also so well thought out. Very nice.', '2020-07-06 13:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
