(7668877, 1251320, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, it''s the little cord that makes the picture.  One can only wonder from whence it came and to where it is going.  But there''s a story in there!</td>', 'Ah, it''s the little cord that makes the picture.  One can only wonder from whence it came and to where it is going.  But there''s a story in there!', '2020-07-06 22:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
