(7668890, 1251202, 50695, '<td valign="top">each step is its own canvas of shadows. each step is to the rhythm. (a tango)<br/> <br/>the plant is merely the subject of the photo, overwhelmed by layers of associations</td>', 'each step is its own canvas of shadows. each step is to the rhythm. (a tango) the plant is merely the subject of the photo, overwhelmed by layers of associations', '2020-07-07 00:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668891, 1251273, 50695, '<td valign="top">photography is indeed strange music. hard to dance to. best not to try at this angle. I don''t even know which way is up. so I''ll just hum along instead, because the rhythm is good. and the simple palette of complimentary red and green is enjoyable as well.</td>', 'photography is indeed strange music. hard to dance to. best not to try at this angle. I don''t even know which way is up. so I''ll just hum along instead, because the rhythm is good. and the simple palette of complimentary red and green is enjoyable as well.', '2020-07-07 00:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668892, 1251316, 50695, '<td valign="top">a quick dizzy look at the city. we never really get a good look at our home. we''re always too busy to notice it. instead of capturing a view that we normally would miss, this photo instead captures the blur of living and not noticing.</td>', 'a quick dizzy look at the city. we never really get a good look at our home. we''re always too busy to notice it. instead of capturing a view that we normally would miss, this photo instead captures the blur of living and not noticing.', '2020-07-07 00:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668893, 1251687, 50695, '<td valign="top">soaked with sentiment, the photo seems in danger of falling apart.</td>', 'soaked with sentiment, the photo seems in danger of falling apart.', '2020-07-07 00:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668894, 1251712, 50695, '<td valign="top">this photo is under construction. the telephone pole is not available yet. for now, you must make do with a shadow and a reflection. We really must apologize for your fractured view. we''re working on it, you can count on that. Be comforted by the large number of signs to that effect. What is photography, after all, besides signs? And here we are on this funny site talking about how lovely the signs are. Sometimes we miss the moon for the finger. But we''re working on it. Soon we''ll have it all pulled together. But if you look now, maybe you''ll see some of that beautiful glue.</td>', 'this photo is under construction. the telephone pole is not available yet. for now, you must make do with a shadow and a reflection. We really must apologize for your fractured view. we''re working on it, you can count on that. Be comforted by the large number of signs to that effect. What is photography, after all, besides signs? And here we are on this funny site talking about how lovely the signs are. Sometimes we miss the moon for the finger. But we''re working on it. Soon we''ll have it all pulled together. But if you look now, maybe you''ll see some of that beautiful glue.', '2020-07-07 00:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7668895, 1251665, 50695, '<td valign="top">who knew whimsy had a back door? and who knew it was so serious? maybe this explains why whimsy works so hard on his facade.</td>', 'who knew whimsy had a back door? and who knew it was so serious? maybe this explains why whimsy works so hard on his facade.', '2020-07-07 00:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
