(7669569, 1251320, 50695, '<td valign="top">every brick has a story to tell. that''s not true but some of them do. or at least some of them have a story written on them. imagine that, walking around with a story written on your face and you don''t even know what it is, except that day after day you encounter people who are reacting to your story.</td>', 'every brick has a story to tell. that''s not true but some of them do. or at least some of them have a story written on them. imagine that, walking around with a story written on your face and you don''t even know what it is, except that day after day you encounter people who are reacting to your story.', '2020-07-12 21:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669570, 1251407, 50695, '<td valign="top">I was sort of there. I never actually went in. I never left the pond, actually. But I did feel some of the architecture subjugating the muck.</td>', 'I was sort of there. I never actually went in. I never left the pond, actually. But I did feel some of the architecture subjugating the muck.', '2020-07-12 21:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669571, 1251617, 50695, '<td valign="top">It was the most delicious wall I ever tasted. You probably would have found it bland, but all I needed was a good swig of rosemary.</td>', 'It was the most delicious wall I ever tasted. You probably would have found it bland, but all I needed was a good swig of rosemary.', '2020-07-12 21:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669572, 1251723, 50695, '<td valign="top">I keep seeing the skull as part of some larger creature materializing from the shore. perhaps if I wait long enough it will shroud itself with a new skin.</td>', 'I keep seeing the skull as part of some larger creature materializing from the shore. perhaps if I wait long enough it will shroud itself with a new skin.', '2020-07-12 21:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669573, 1251683, 50695, '<td valign="top">of course there are many many images of this ilk but I like how this one is executed. I like how you can see a frond behind it but it is out of focus and the front frond stands out sharply. I like the little white dots, the highlights, and the way some blades give up and curve at the end.</td>', 'of course there are many many images of this ilk but I like how this one is executed. I like how you can see a frond behind it but it is out of focus and the front frond stands out sharply. I like the little white dots, the highlights, and the way some blades give up and curve at the end.', '2020-07-12 21:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669574, 1251443, 50695, '<td valign="top">The dog performs well, better than most humans. I know exactly what it''s feeling. A perfectly good sandwich, and even some chips. just sitting there doing nothing, like a photograph.</td>', 'The dog performs well, better than most humans. I know exactly what it''s feeling. A perfectly good sandwich, and even some chips. just sitting there doing nothing, like a photograph.', '2020-07-12 21:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
