(7669752, 1251722, 173844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top five finish.  I appreciate that several people thought it was my entry.  That means I''m doing something right.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top five finish.  I appreciate that several people thought it was my entry.  That means I''m doing something right.', '2020-07-13 17:43:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7669758, 1251254, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on winning the yellow.  This is one of the images I "favorited," and I''m so looking forward to seeing your new drone photos.  A whole new world beckons! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You bet it does! Only when <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/19825.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/19825.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/19825.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=19825" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">MarkWiley</a> kindly sent his drone to me for an exploratory spin did I realize how burned out I had gotten with photography-from-eye-level over all these years. And to make things worse, it''s very difficult for me to kneel or lie down on the ground now, or at least to get up from same :-) So within 24 hours of the loan I was hooked and had ordered my very own drone.<br/> <br/>It''s a complete revelation, such an interesting "new" way to see &amp; explore!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-07-13 17:29:49.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: Congratulations on winning the yellow.  This is one of the images I "favorited," and I''m so looking forward to seeing your new drone photos.  A whole new world beckons!  You bet it does! Only when  MarkWiley kindly sent his drone to me for an exploratory spin did I realize how burned out I had gotten with photography-from-eye-level over all these years. And to make things worse, it''s very difficult for me to kneel or lie down on the ground now, or at least to get up from same :-) So within 24 hours of the loan I was hooked and had ordered my very own drone. It''s a complete revelation, such an interesting "new" way to see & explore!', '2020-07-13 18:29:15.000000', '2020-07-13 18:29:49.000000', 0),
(7669763, 1251720, 53814, '<td valign="top">My sisters and I had a side challenge to try and guess which entry was yours. <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=55542" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">aberration</a> thought this was your entry and I told her "there is no way it is his". I''m glad we didn''t bet money on it. I really like this but I was sure it was a <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=35804" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">RKT</a> creation. This was a fun challenge. Thank you for the inspiration and for the time you took to comment on all of the entries.</td>', 'My sisters and I had a side challenge to try and guess which entry was yours.  aberration thought this was your entry and I told her "there is no way it is his". I''m glad we didn''t bet money on it. I really like this but I was sure it was a  RKT creation. This was a fun challenge. Thank you for the inspiration and for the time you took to comment on all of the entries.', '2020-07-13 19:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7669778, 1251662, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on winning the red.  I''m really pleased that a few people thought this was mine, and I''ll accept the compliment. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: Congratulations on winning the red.  I''m really pleased that a few people thought this was mine, and I''ll accept the compliment.   :)', '2020-07-13 20:35:09.000000', NULL, 0),
